== Purge ==
Command:
* <code>/purge amount:&lt;1-100&gt;</code>

Behavior:
* Deletes recent and old messages
* Skips pinned messages
* Reports deleted/skipped/failed counts

== Citizens Role Panel ==
1. Run <code>/admin post-citizens-panel</code>
2. Bot posts or refreshes the role button in '''Immigration-Center'''
3. Users click the button to get the '''Citizens''' role

== Required Setup ==
* Bot role must be above '''Citizens''' in role hierarchy for role assignment to succeed.
* Keep admin access restricted with bot allowlist policy.

